        411.84881591796875,
        243.12513732910156,
        426.2918395996094
      ],
      "text": "TPT held value for them (“values”);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.0489196777344,
        78.23609924316406,
        439.491943359375
      ],
      "text": "•",
