      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        425.0489196777344,
        515.4807739257812,
        439.491943359375
      ],
      "text": "TPT effectiveness, requirements and safety met their subjective thresholds (“preferences”); and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.2488098144531,
        78.23609924316406,
        452.69183349609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        438.2488098144531,
        447.5304870605469,
        452.69183349609375
      ],
      "text": "they anticipated being able to complete the treatment successfully (“feasibility”).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.95281982421875,
        527.5092163085938,
        474.3958435058594
      ],
      "text": "The participants’ values were influenced by their sociocultural and economic contexts, as well personal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96579647064209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.1528015136719,
        527.19189453125,
        487.5958251953125
      ],
      "text": "and community experiences with MDR-TB. The values aligned with higher TPT acceptability included:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988093376159668,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.8567199707031,
        78.23609924316406,
        509.29974365234375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        494.8567199707031,
        391.81219482421875,
        509.29974365234375
      ],
      "text": "belief in the importance of disease prevention, such as vaccination;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.05670166015625,
        78.23609924316406,
        522.4996948242188
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        508.05670166015625,
        527.4552612304688,
        522.4996948242188
      ],
      "text": "general trust in medicines and doctors, “The doctor knows best, so whatever they give, I have to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        521.2567138671875,
        236.09521484375,
        535.69970703125
      ],
      "text": "take.” (India, 45-year-old woman);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.4566650390625,
        78.23609924316406,
        548.899658203125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        534.4566650390625,
        527.4169921875,
        548.899658203125
      ],
      "text": "fear of MDR-TB disease, its treatment and contagiousness, “I would feel so bad if I got MDR-TB,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        547.65673828125,
        527.454345703125,
        562.0997314453125
      ],
      "text": "it will be very painful….TPT is a good thing because I have younger grandkids and we don’t know",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        560.856689453125,
        354.1954345703125,
        575.2996826171875
      ],
      "text": "when they will catch it.” (South Africa, 50-year-old woman).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        574.0567016601562,
        78.23609924316406,
        588.4996948242188
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        574.0567016601562,
        527.4387817382812,
        588.4996948242188
      ],
      "text": "A participant’s values could override the perceived benefits and harms of TPT. For instance, a few",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        587.2567138671875,
        527.2619018554688,
        601.69970703125
      ],
      "text": "participants who did not value disease prevention would refuse MDR TPT, regardless of its potential",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974470138549805,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        600.4567260742188,
        395.16168212890625,
        614.8997192382812
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness, low requirements and safety, unless it was mandatory.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.1605834960938,
        527.4361572265625,
        636.6035766601562
      ],
      "text": "Among participants who found value in TPT, acceptance depended on their subjective thresholds for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993147850036621,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.3607177734375,
        527.4180908203125,
        649.8037109375
      ],
      "text": "treatment effectiveness, dosage and schedule and adverse drug reactions. For instance, participants",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.5606689453125,
        527.4189453125,
        663.003662109375
      ],
      "text": "would tolerate mild-to-moderate side-effects and long treatment duration, if they had a minimum level",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.946319580078125,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.7607421875,
        527.3380737304688,
        676.2037353515625
      ],
      "text": "of efficacy (such as reducing the risk of disease by 50%), but not if TPT efficacy was below that threshold.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.960693359375,
        527.4431762695312,
        689.4036865234375
      ],
      "text": "Given an acceptable level of efficacy, most participants prioritized safety over treatment duration;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.1605834960938,
        527.4144897460938,
        702.6035766601562
      ],
      "text": "treatment schedule was considered the least important. The final consideration of acceptability was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        701.3607177734375,
        527.5206909179688,
        715.8037109375
      ],
      "text": "perceived feasibility. Participants who valued TPT reflected on demands on their lives due to TPT. They",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977375984191895,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.5607299804688,
        527.4205932617188,
        729.0037231445312
      ],
      "text": "considered the following as potential barriers: out-of-pocket expenses (e.g. transport); disruption due",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986592292785645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        727.7606811523438,
        527.4354248046875,
        742.2036743164062
      ],
      "text": "to clinical follow-up, time commitment and requirement for child-care arrangements; lack of social",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.960693359375,
        418.7807922363281,
        755.4036865234375
      ],
      "text": "and financial support; and insufficient treatment counselling and education.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        349.7414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.0995483398438,
        811.52099609375
      ],
